Haryanvi Programming Language
Apni Bhasha, Apna Code!

Haryana’s first programming language.
Where "syntax error" sounds like "Bhai, galat likh diya re!" 😆

📖 What Is This?

HaryanviLang is a transpiler that turns desi Haryanvi code into JavaScript.
So tu likh bol "Ram Ram", aur ye JS bana dega console.log("Ram Ram").

Simple, fun, aur thoda attitude ke sath! 😎

⚙️ Setup (10 second ka kaam)
git clone https://github.com/sanju-vashist/hr-coding.git
cd haryanvi-lang
npm install
node index.js

run command ===> node run.js


Done. Ab tu coder ban gaya. 🎉

🧠 Syntax Samajh Lo Bhai
Haryanvi Word	Matlab in English
ye	declare variable
bol	print something
jab	if condition
nahi_toh	else
jab_tak	while loop
sahi / galat	true / false
👋 Hello World
bol "Ram Ram bhai saryene!"


Output:

Ram Ram bhai saryene!

📦 Variables (Apna Dabba)
ye naam = "Sandeep"
ye umar = 22
bol naam


“ye” likhke variable banao, jaise “ye mera phone hai” 📱

➕ Ganit (Math bhi aave se)
ye a = 10
ye b = 5
bol a + b
bol a * b


BODMAS bhi follow karega, bhai ne cheating nahi kari. 😏

🤔 Faisla Lena (Decision Making)
ye age = 16

jab (age >= 18) {
  bol "Vote de sakta hai!"
} nahi_toh {
  bol "Chhoro, abhi school ja!"
}


jab = if, nahi_toh = else.
Seedha logic, bina drama ke.

🔁 Loop Lagao Bhai (Repeat Karna)
ye i = 1
jab_tak (i <= 5) {
  bol i
  i = i + 1
}


Output:

1  
2  
3  
4  
5  


Loop chalega jab tak patience khatam nahi hota. 😅

💬 Comments (Bakbak Code Mein)
// Ye comment hai, chalne ka nahi
ye marks = 99  // topper spotted

🎯 Example: Simple Bill
ye chai = 10
ye samosa = 20
ye total = chai + samosa
bol "Bill aa gaya bhai:"
bol total


“GST nahi lagaya, tu apna dost hai.” 😄

🧮 Example: Ganit Wali Game
ye num = 10
ye sum = 0

jab_tak (num > 0) {
  sum = sum + num
  num = num - 1
}

bol "Total:" 
bol sum


10 se 1 tak jod ke dekh — maths bhi desi ho gaya.

🧑‍🎓 Grade System Example
ye marks = 85

jab (marks >= 90) {
  bol "A+ - Bhai top kar gaya!"
} nahi_toh {
  jab (marks >= 60) {
    bol "Pass ho gaya, mithai lao!"
  } nahi_toh {
    bol "Fail - dobara koshish kar bhai!"
  }
}

🕹 Mini Projects (Thoda Kaam, Thoda Mazak)
💡 Calculator
ye a = 10
ye b = 2
bol "Add:" 
bol a + b

⚡ Electricity Bill
ye units = 250
ye bill = 0

jab (units <= 100) {
  bill = units * 5
} nahi_toh {
  bill = 100 * 5 + (units - 100) * 7
}

bol "Bill amount:"
bol bill


“Bijli board ko bhejna mat, sirf seekhne ke liye hai.” 😜

🧠 Practice Karle Thoda

